#DESCRIPTION
Restart regression test (Hybrid PIC, FIELDSOLVER hybrid).
Session 1 runs cycles 0..5 of a 1D periodic magnetized HybridWave with Hall
term, moment smoothing, and evolved electron pressure equation and writes a
checkpoint at cycle 5; Session 2 continues uninterrupted to cycle 10.
validate.py restarts from PC/restartIN/ at cycle 5 via FLEKS1_restart.H and
verifies exact agreement (relative diff < 1e-10) on cycles 5..10 energy logs
and cycle-10 real8 plot fields.

#INITFROMSWMF
F                       initFromSWMF

#GEOMETRY
-3.2                    xMin
 3.2                    xMax
-0.1                    yMin
 0.1                    yMax
-0.1                    zMin
 0.1                    zMax

#NCELL
32                      nCellX
1                       nCellY
1                       nCellZ

#MAXBLOCKSIZE
8                       maxBlockSizeX
1                       maxBlockSizeY
1                       maxBlockSizeZ

#PERIODICITY
T                       isPeriodicX
T                       isPeriodicY
T                       isPeriodicZ

#FIELDSOLVER
hybrid

#FIELDINTEGRATOR
rk4

#HALLTERM
T                       useHallTerm

#BSUBCYCLE
2                       nBSubcycle

#RESISTIVITY
0.0                     etaResistivity

#ELECTRONTEMPERATURE
20.0                    electronTemperature [eV]
1.6666666666666667      electronGamma
5.0                     electronDensity0 [amu/cc]

#ELECTRONPRESSURE
T                       useElectronPressureEq
0.0                     heatCondKappa0SI
20.0                    coulombLog
T                       fieldAlignedConduction
1.0                     fieldAlignedFraction
1.0e-15                 fieldAlignedBMinSI
0.0                     heatFluxLimiter
0.0                     peMin
T                       ambipolarInStages

#SMOOTHMOMENTS
T                       doSmoothMoments
1                       nSmoothMoments
0.5                     coefSmoothMoments

#PLASMA
1                       nSpecies
1.0                     mass        Species 0: ion
1.0                     charge

#UNIFORMSTATE
5.0                     rho [/cc]   Species 0: ion
0.0                     ux [km/s]
0.0                     uy [km/s]
0.0                     uz [km/s]
10000.0                 T [K]
1.0439e-8               bx [T]
0.0                     by [T]
0.0                     bz [T]
0.0                     ex [V/m]
0.0                     ey [V/m]
0.0                     ez [V/m]

#TESTCASE
HybridWave

#TIMESTEPPING
T                       useFixedDt
0.01                    dt

#NORMALIZATION
1.0e5                   lNormSI
1.0e5                   uNormSI

#MONITOR
10                      dnReport

#SAVELOG
1                       dnSavePic
1                       dnSavePT

#PARTICLES
16                      nParticle per cell in X
1                       nParticle per cell in Y
1                       nParticle per cell in Z

#SAVEPLOT
1                       nPlot
z=0 fluid real8 pic     plotString
5                       dn
-1.0                    dt
1                       dx

#SAVERESTART
T                       doSaveRestart
5                       dnSaveRestart
-1.0                    dtSaveRestart

#STOP
5                       MaxIter
-1.0                    TimeMax

#RUN

#SAVERESTART
F                       doSaveRestart

#STOP
10                      MaxIter
-1.0                    TimeMax
